    cme:renewalStatus "Built on 2026-10-08 to the CME materials look-and-feel standard, ported onto this course's line together with chapter 6: 26 slides (title, route, questions, 21 teaching slides, summary, resources, a closing content slide), with exact agenda ranges and a takeaway strip on 25 of 25 non-title slides. Re-verified in this session under Python 3.14.6 (the interpreter the recording was made under): deck_check found 49 console rows, 1 native chart and 1 table re-computed with 0 mismatches; program_check found 9 program panels with 0 mismatches. Four dated, sourced 5N1K stories with credited photographs: Guido van Rossum (CC BY-SA 4.0), George Orwell (public domain), a Staunton chess set (CC0) and Douglas Crockford (CC0). The 1st edition covered this material in its chapter 5, so this deck renews sen0414:Deck_11. One open item carried over honestly: the session that built this deck also found the chapter 1-6 standard's deep-passage search still missing the single word 'constructor' for this chapter specifically (a shared textbook-ontology boilerplate line outranks the chapter's own finding); the underlying research record was corrected regardless (sen0414_ch07_research_v1_2_0.ttl), but the page was rebuilt again afterwards (to 9.28.0, template parity with chapters 1-6) without a recorded re-run of the full page-test suite against that exact file, so this one known search-ranking issue should be treated as still open for chapter 7's page until it is re-tested." ;
