    cme:renewalStatus "New with the 3rd edition, which added this chapter; no 1st-edition deck covers it, so it replaces none. Built on 2026-10-11 to the CME materials look-and-feel standard v1.0.0 (shared renderer): 26 numbered warm-ivory slides, agenda with exact ranges, summary before the live-linked resources, takeaway strips throughout, and four dated, sourced 5N1K stories with fact rows and no photographs (Wikimedia Commons answered HTTP 429): McIlroy and Thompson's pipes of 1973, Ritchie's #! email of 10 January 1980, Socha's Norton Commander of 1986 and Bicking's pyinstall of 24 September 2008. Eleven console sessions and eight whole programs run under Python 3.14.6 on Ubuntu - a real virtual environment, the chapter's Ubuntu launcher executed (it forwards no arguments without $@), ccwd.py and cliprec.py run unchanged against a stand-in clipboard - verified by deck_check and program_check (0 mismatches), with the layout, fit and notes checks clean." ;
